================================================================================
FORM DATA STRUCTURE
================================================================================

While editing a form, numeric controls can conveniently remain strings:

const INITIAL_FORM = {

  name: '',

  quantity: '1',

  category: 'Produce',

  price: '0'

}


WHY?
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

HTML number inputs use:

event.target.value


which normally provides a string.

Examples:

"1"

"25"

"3.99"

""


After validation, convert values when creating/updating the grocery record.


